<title>ST VINCENT AND THE GRENADINES: CRICKET-RAIN HOLDS UP PLAY IN WINDIES V LANKA TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RAIN HOLDS UP PLAY IN WINDIES V LANKA TEST.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rain prevented any play between lunch and tea on the third day of the second test between West Indies and Sri Lanka on Sunday.</p>
<p>West Indies, 75 in arrears on the first innings, were 124 for two in their second innings.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 147 and 124 for two; Sri Lanka 222.</p>
